        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Emtek AP-86351, Bar Appliance Handle</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe Bar Appliance Door Pull is available in 12 inch and 18 inch sizes. It will fit most standard appliance panels including those on refrigerators, freezers, and other large appliances all over your kitchen. The Bar Refrigerator Pull is available in a wide array of modern finishes. The ladder shape is one of the most popular for door handles because of its ability to look good no matter what the decor around it. \r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> of the Emtek Bar Refrigerator Pull:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material: Brass</li>\r\n<li>Pull Mounting: Standard 3/4\" Thick Appliance Panel</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/EMT-AP-86351-specifications.pdf?v=1704262357\"><b>Emtek Bar Pull Dimensions Diagram (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Available in 2 Sizes:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<b>EMT-AP-86351:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Total Length: 15-1/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Center to Center Length: 12\"</li>\r\n<li>Pull Handle Diameter: 7/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Total Projection: 2\"</li>\r\n<li>Base: 5/8\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<br>\r\n<b>EMT-AP-86352:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Total Length: 21-1/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Center to Center Length: 18\"</li>\r\n<li>Pull Handle Diameter: 7/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Total Projection: 2\"</li>\r\n<li>Base: 5/8\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p align=\"center\">\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/EMT-modern-levers-Finishes.jpg?v=1704354533\" width=\"599\" height=\"111\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Emtek Finish Chart\">\r\n</p>",
